        <mxCell id="c_v34" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; AssuranceFacade is the only entry point: Module 3 calls IAssess.assess() once per request (A8); a timeout gives an engine_failure hold, never a default state (FR-T-07).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Trust and manipulation risk stay separate attributes of AssessmentResult and are never averaged (FR-T-06).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; RatingVelocity (S2), NewAccountActivity (S3) and InvitationLinkage (S5) are the iteration 2 SignalCheck realisations (green).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; BetaPosteriorEstimator.posterior_mean is also the trust-edge weight (ADR-0006).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Relationship ends: &amp;#9670; composition, &amp;#9671; aggregation, dashed open arrow = dependency, dashed hollow triangle = realisation." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#8C99A6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
