          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v7" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; One diagram for the whole system: every class appears once, in the package of the module that owns it. Packages with a dot are parts of one module (accounts.membership is Module 1, search.retrieval, search.ranking and search logging are Module 4).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; A dependency on a class of another module is shown by its type in the attribute or operation (for example &lt;i&gt;- notify: INotify&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;- engine: AssuranceEngine&lt;/i&gt;); the module dependencies are the component diagram. Lines cross package borders only where one class uses another directly: Registration creates a User, InvitationService uses the verifier, a BorrowingTransaction holds its open CounterOffer, JobRunner acts through BorrowingService.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;font color='#0A7A36'&gt;Green text&lt;/font&gt; = added or changed in iteration 2; &lt;font color='#0A7A36'&gt;green border&lt;/font&gt; = class new in iteration 2. Everything else is as built in iteration 1.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Interfaces between students: IAssess, IOutcomeSink (Module 5, S2); ILifecycleCommands, IEventQuery, JobRunner, ISearch (Modules 3 and 4, S1); INotify (Module 7, S2); IOutcomeFlags (Module 5, S2); SearchLogger (Module 4, S3).&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Relationship ends: &amp;#9670; composition, &amp;#9671; aggregation, plain line = association, dashed open arrow = dependency, dashed hollow triangle = realisation. The iteration 1 diagrams, one per student, are in archive_v1/." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#8C99A6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2750" y="2911" width="1860" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>